#: ../../../reference/interfaces/opengl-interface.md:2
msgid "opengl interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/opengl-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`opengl` allows access to the OpenGL stack and, consequently, OpenGL "
"hardware, which may be needed for certain types of graphical applications "
"and those that use [CUDA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CUDA) libraries for "
"computation. See [Adding OpenGL/GPU support to a snap](https://"
"forum.snapcraft.io/t/adding-opengl-gpu-support-to-a-snap/6273) for more "
"information on how to use this interface."
msgstr ""

